sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant TimeRecord as TimeRecord
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+TimeRecord: correct(clockInAt, clockOutAt, breakMinutes, notes)
    Note over TimeRecord: Policies: timeRecordRead, timeRecordWrite, timeRecordExecute
    Note over TimeRecord: Guards (5)
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;closed#quot; or self.status == #quot;corrected#quot;
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: guard[1]: self.clockInAt != null
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: guard[2]: self.clockOutAt != null
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: guard[3]: self.deletedAt == null
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: guard[4]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;workforceManageAccess#quot;)
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: compute.previousClockInAt
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: compute.previousClockOutAt
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: compute.previousBreakMinutes
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: mutate.clockInAt
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: mutate.clockOutAt
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: mutate.breakMinutes
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: mutate.notes
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: mutate.status
    TimeRecord->>TimeRecord: mutate.correctedAt
    TimeRecord->>EventBus: emit TimeRecordCorrected on time_record.corrected
    TimeRecord-->>-Client: void